Z||000000||zeelebuba||10-07-2001||12:20 PM||||  Does anybody have any experiance with 4spd auto transmission wiring? Im useing a 3300 with a turbo and decided rather than messing with fuel risers an extra injectors to use a Holly 950 computer(pricing was VERY good on this unit btw Haltech and others was 2700+ while the holly was 800 some dollers).<BR>  I was going to have the stock ECU to run the ignition and other stuff but im leaning towards a msd or holly ignition and totally losing the stock ECU. My major concern is all them wires coming out of the tranny.<P>  Is the only important one the Lock up circut?<BR> Near as i can see all the others are for Park/nuetrel start postion and gear feedback for the stock ecu to know how fast and what gear its in||||reg||5
